OL,5,G1600 Rise of the Nazis
OL,6,     FStalingrad: The Nazis have lost in
OL,7,     FMoscow and Hitler and Stalin now
OL,8,     Ftake charge of their armies - with
OL,9,     Fno-one to hold them back, Hitler
OL,10,     Fhas met his match in a fight to
OL,11,     Fthe death.
OL,12,G1700 The World at War
OL,13,     FOccupation: Hear how the
OL,14,     FNetherlands lived under Nazi rule
OL,15,     Ffor four years and how its people
OL,16,     Fdecided where their loyalties lay.
OL,17,     FNarrated by the late, great
OL,18,     FLaurence Olivier.
